# CoHendrix

`AGENTS.md` is the source of truth for how to work in this repository.

Before starting, read `AGENTS.md`, then `CONTEXT.md` and the latest `CHANGELOG.md` entry. After finishing, append a changelog entry and update `CONTEXT.md` if goals, status, or open questions changed.

Do not treat this rule file as a second rulebook. If it conflicts with `AGENTS.md`, follow `AGENTS.md`.
